OL,4,CIranian authorities flog singer who    
OL,5,Cperformed without hijab, lawyers say   
OL,6,GA prominent singer who performed       
OL,7,Gwithout the mandatory hijab and four   
OL,8,Gmembers of her band and production     
OL,9,Gteam have been flogged by Iranian      
OL,10,Gauthorities, lawyers say.              
OL,12,FParastoo Ahmadi, three musicians and a 
OL,13,Fproducer were each given 74 lashes in  
OL,14,Fthe city of Qom, a member of their     
OL,15,Fdefence team told the BBC.             
